{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROTATO is a fast-paced roguelite survival game, very easy to play but hard to master! Spin your cannons around your planet to fight your way through hordes of cute (but deadly) aliens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.poster.avif?t=1767436816\" width=640 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.webm?t=1767436816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.mp4?t=1767436816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies  to level up! Each card upgrade offer is random so each run is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/a3c6f6a53bf38e4710aac20d580ab5a7.apng?t=1767436816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/a3c6f6a53bf38e4710aac20d580ab5a7.poster.avif?t=1767436816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of weapons, traits and items to create crazy unique builds and survive until... well, you'll see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button gameplay - spin your cannons against waves of aliens!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick runs under 30min!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 planets with unique cannons &amp; abilities to customize your runs and try different strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 30 escalating waves - aliens get cuter... and deadlier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons between waves and your powerups and items between games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy &amp; Hardcore modes available</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806230?t=1767436816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806230?t=1767436816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/2f5611dc96a0297f7615c789c14fa00a8860a6f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767436816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/2f5611dc96a0297f7615c789c14fa00a8860a6f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767436816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROTATO is a fast-paced roguelite survival game, very easy to play but hard to master! Spin your cannons around your planet to fight your way through hordes of cute (but deadly) aliens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.poster.avif?t=1767436816\" width=640 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.webm?t=1767436816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806230/extras/fa2a87cd83e758b3ccbadb62abc1eeb0.mp4?t=1767436816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies  to level up! Each card upgrade offer is random so each run is unique!</p><p clas